em pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">We met at mealtimes.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/db/We_met_at_mealtimes..png/revision/latest?cb=20210210192753\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"We met at mealtimes.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/db/We_met_at_mealtimes..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210210192753\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/db/We_met_at_mealtimes..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210210192753 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/db/We_met_at_mealtimes..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210210192753 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"We met at mealtimes.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"We_met_at_mealtimes..png\" data-image-name=\"We met at mealtimes..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_6\" title=\"Series 6\">6</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Vine\" title=\"Tim Vine\">Tim Vine</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/H.\" title=\"H.\">H.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Roadkill_doused_in_syrup.\" title=\"Roadkill doused in syrup.\">Roadkill doused in syrup.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>We met at mealtimes.</b></i> is the sixth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_6\" title=\"Series 6\">Series 6</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 6 June 2018. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Vine\" title=\"Tim Vine\">Tim Vine</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/We_met_at_mealtimes.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"We met at mealtimes\" was <a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Vine\" title=\"Tim Vine\">Tim Vine</a>'s explanation of how well he knew the character \"Sarge\" from his performance in the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_parachute_for_this_wooden_spoon\" title=\"Make the best parachute for this wooden spoon\">Make the best parachute for this wooden spoon</a> task. The title card is the triangle of ducks used for the <a href=\"/wiki/Knock_over_as_many_ducks_as_possible\" title=\"Knock over as many ducks as possible\">Knock over as many ducks as possible</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/We_met_at_mealtimes.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Vi så hinanden til måltiderne', which translates as 'We saw each other at mealtimes'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Tapasimme ruoka-aikoina', which translates as 'We met at mealtimes'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Vi møtes i lunsjen', which translates as 'We meet at lunch'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title. <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/We_met_at_mealtimes.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Alice_Levine\" title=\"Alice Levine\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Alice Levine</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Asim_Chaudhry\" title=\"Asim Chaudhry\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Asim Chaudhry</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Liza_Tarbuck\" title=\"Liza Tarbuck\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Liza Tarbuck</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Russell_Howard\" title=\"Russell Howard\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Russell Howard</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Vine\" title=\"Tim Vine\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Tim Vine</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_that_they%27ve_invented\" title=\"Best thing that they&#39;ve invented\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing that they've invented.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_snow_globe\" title=\"Make the best snow globe\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the best snow globe.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Knock_over_as_many_ducks_as_possible\" title=\"Knock over as many ducks as possible\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Knock over as many ducks as possible. You must all remain on the red carpet throughout the task.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_an_announcement\" title=\"Make an announcement\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make an announcement. Biggest announcement to the most people wins.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_parachute_for_this_wooden_spoon\" title=\"Make the best parachute for this wooden spoon\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the best parachute for this wooden spoon. Slowest and most dramatic fall wins.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Predict_how_many_answers_you_will_give\" title=\"Predict how many answers you will give\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> You will each be given a category. You will each have 10 seconds to say things in that fall into that category. First, you must each predict how many correct answers you will give.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>23</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/We_met_at_mealtimes.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_6,_Episode_6_-_Full_Episode_-_%27We_Met_at_Mealtimes.%27\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/8/82/Taskmaster_-_Series_6%2C_Episode_6_-_Full_Episode_-_%27We_Met_a